WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.115 line:82%
Chapter 15. More: your phone as a remote, the timetable, two schools, settings, and the Android app.

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:15.193 line:82%
Walk around the class, and run the test from your own phone. On the live screen, press "Phone remote".

00:00:15.652 --> 00:00:24.172 line:82%
On your phone, scan the QR code, and type the PIN. Do it once, before the students arrive. Your phone is remembered.

00:00:24.623 --> 00:00:34.652 line:82%
Now the phone controls the test. You see who has not answered yet, and the right answer. Only you see it. The laptop and the projector follow your phone.

00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:39.632 line:82%
The Class tab gives a thumbs up, or a thumbs down, to any student.

00:00:40.097 --> 00:00:47.953 line:82%
Projector mode hides the menu, and makes everything bigger. Press the screen button at the top. Press it again to go back.

00:00:48.409 --> 00:00:55.893 line:82%
Do you teach in two schools? Open "More", then "Settings". Press "Add a school", write its name, and press "Save".

00:00:59.179 --> 00:01:07.612 line:82%
Then choose the school of each class: on the Students page, open "Class details", and choose the school. Press "Save class".

00:01:08.073 --> 00:01:12.214 line:82%
Now open "Timetable". There is a tab for each school.

00:01:12.666 --> 00:01:20.313 line:82%
Choose a class, then click its hours. Drag across the boxes for long lessons. Then press "Save timetable".

00:01:22.202 --> 00:01:30.434 line:82%
The app now knows your classes. At class time, it opens the right class by itself. Home shows your classes of the day.

00:01:30.887 --> 00:01:34.932 line:82%
In Settings, you also find the colours, light or dark.

00:01:35.385 --> 00:01:42.772 line:82%
Focus during tests: a student who leaves the quiz for 3 seconds gets that question wrong, and you see it.

00:01:43.225 --> 00:01:53.612 line:82%
Press "Save a backup" every few weeks, and keep the file on a USB key or Google Drive. On a new laptop, install the app, and restore the backup.

00:01:54.072 --> 00:02:02.093 line:82%
"Help and videos" has short answers for every part of the app, and all these videos. Type a word to find a topic.

00:02:02.547 --> 00:02:13.332 line:82%
No laptop? The Android app does everything the laptop does. Send the file "MI WAY Classroom dot APK" by WhatsApp or Google Drive, and install it.

00:02:13.785 --> 00:02:17.473 line:82%
The menu is behind this button, at the top left.

00:02:17.934 --> 00:02:29.373 line:82%
Students join the phone's hotspot. You don't need the internet. Most hotspots allow about 10 phones: students work in pairs, or you use a small pocket Wi-Fi router.

00:02:29.838 --> 00:02:41.173 line:82%
Files are saved in "Downloads, MI WAY". Move your classes between the laptop and the phone with a backup. iPhones can't run the app, but students can join with any phone.
